<title>CHINA: Shanghai Petrochemical 96 net plunges 52.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Petrochemical 96 net plunges 52.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>			    1996			    1995</p>
<p> Turnover	  12,203.768	vs	  12,061.463</p>
<p> Net profit	 1,008.180	vs	   2,126.796</p>
<p> Net asset per share     1.69  yuan    vs    1.60 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.162 yuan    vs    0.325 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a company statement. The net profit numbers are based on international accounting standards, other figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>Based on domestic accounting standards, 1996 net profit was 1,144.817 million yuan against 2,126.796 million yuan in 1995.</p>
</text>
